The '''Honor of Kings World Cup 2025''' was an inaugural edition of the tournament, held as a midseason tournament for [[Honor of Kings]] in 2025.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/HoKEsports/status/1851187221015261206|title=2025 Honor of Kings Invitational Midseason Riyadh, Saudi Arabia|date=2024-10-19|author=HoK Global Esports|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/HoKEsports/status/1895764018931138887|title=2025 Honor of Kings Esports: Unveiling the Roadmap!|author=HoK Global Esports|date=2025-03-01|language={{flag|usuk}} English}}</ref> The tournament marks the return of the '''World Cup''' moniker since the cancellation of [[AWC 2022]], and the first of the series under the [[Honor of Kings]] version.

KWC 2025 was the first time a major Honor of Kings tournament use the [[starcraft2:Dual_Tournament_Format|GSL format]] for the Group Stage.

{{heroIcon|alessio|size=24px}} '''Alessio - Heavenpulse''' was the commemorative skin for KWC 2025, which can be obtained through a free Battle Pass.

:''See [[esports:Esports_World_Cup/2025|here]] to read about the Esports World Cup 2025, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

