==Format==
* '''Note: In pro play (as adopted in [[King Pro League]]), all classes of ''Flowborn'' are considered as one hero for the purposes of pick, but individual heroes for purposes of bans.''' As such:
** A team can only pick ''Flowborn'' (regardless of class) once per Global Banpick rules
** ''Flowborn'' can only appear on one side for every game
** ''Flowborn (Tank)'' and ''Flowborn (Marksman)'' must be separately banned
* '''Group Stage''' - ''July 15<sup>th</sup> - 19<sup>th</sup>''
** 16 teams will be split into 4 groups of 4
** GSL {{Abbr/Bo3}} for each group
** <span class="bg-up">Group Winners</span> qualify for the Playoffs and Group Kings
** <span class="bg-stayup">Group Runners-up</span> advance to Last Chance
* '''Last Chance''' - ''July 20<sup>th</sup>''
** 4 teams composed of Group Runners-up will be drawn into 2 matchups
** Teams play a single {{Abbr/Bo5}}
*** Matches will be predetermined to be the following: '''A2 vs B2''', and '''C2 vs D2'''
** <span class="bg-up">Winners</span> qualify for the Playoffs
* '''Group Kings''' - ''July 20<sup>th</sup>''
** 4 teams composed of Group Winners will be drawn into 2 matchups
** Teams play a single {{Abbr/Bo3}}
*** Matches will be predetermined to be the following: '''A1 vs B1''', and '''C1 vs D1'''
** <span class="bg-byeup">Winners</span> placed in Top 4 Pool
** <span class="bg-stayup">Losers</span> placed in Bottom 4 Pool
* '''Playoffs''' - ''July 23<sup>rd</sup> - 26<sup>th</sup>''
** KPL and ACL Winners enter at this stage
** Single Elimination {{Abbr/Bo7}} with 3rd place match {{Abbr/Bo5}}
* All matches are '''[[Global Banpick|Global Ban/Pick]]''' with '''Ultimate Battle''' for Game 7.
{{UltimateBattle}}

===KWC Draw Show===
* '''Group Stage''' - ''June 24<sup>th</sup>''
** One Pool of 16 teams are randomly drawn into four groups
** No Region protection
* '''Playoffs''' - ''July 20<sup>th</sup>''
** [https://www.youtube.com/live/w2x0AGdOQos?t=30582 Click here for link to Draw Show]
** Two Pools with no Region/Group protection
*** '''Top 4 Pool''': Winners from Group Kings and KPL/ACL teams (''AG.AL'', ''Nova'', ''Paws'', ''TT'')
*** '''Bottom 4 Pool''': Losers from Group Kings and Last Chance teams (''OG'', ''A7'', ''VIT'', ''TWIS'')
** Each match is guaranteed to be a '''Top 4 Pool''' team vs '''Bottom 4 Pool''' team
