==Format==
* '''Note: In pro play, all classes of ''Flowborn'' are considered as one hero for the purposes of pick, but individual heroes for purposes of bans.''' As such:
** A team can only pick ''Flowborn'' (regardless of class) once per Global Banpick rules
** ''Flowborn'' can only appear on one side for every game
* Different from the [[King Pro League]] (KPL), game will not be played back-to-back without break.
* '''Play-ins''' - ''July 30<sup>th</sup> - 31<sup>st</sup>''
** 8 teams will be split into 2 groups of 4 
** GSL {{Abbr/Bo3}} for each group
** <span class="bg-up">Top 2 teams</span> from each group qualify for the Group Stage
* '''Group Stage''' - ''August 1<sup>st</sup> - 4<sup>th</sup>''
** 16 teams will be split into 4 groups of 4
** GSL {{Abbr/Bo3}} for each group
** <span class="bg-up">Top 2 teams</span> from each group qualify for the Playoffs
* '''Playoffs''' - ''August 5<sup>th</sup> - 8<sup>th</sup>''
** Single Elimination {{Abbr/Bo7}} with 3rd place match {{Abbr/Bo5}}
* All matches are '''[[Global Banpick|Global Ban/Pick]]''' with '''Ultimate Battle''' for Game 7.
<ul><li>{{UltimateBattle}}</li></ul>

===KWC Draw Show===
* '''Play-in''' - ''July 3<sup>rd</sup>, 2026''
** One Pool of 8 teams are randomly drawn into two groups
** No more than 2 AoV teams per group
* '''Group Stage''' - ''July 31<sup>st</sup>, 2026'' - After Play-in
** Four Pools
*** '''Pool 1''': ''AG.AL'', ''KSG'', ''AUR'', ''GK''
*** '''Pool 2''': ''BOOM'', ''ROC'', ''VIT'', ''VP''
*** '''Pool 3''': ''TEC'', ''NMSS'', ''MIBR.LOS'', ''RNTX''
*** '''Pool 4''': ''INF'', ''DCG'', ''BRU'', ''BLCK'' (Play-in teams)
** Each group gets one team per pool
** Pool 1 teams are fixed, the rest will be drawn randomly
* '''Knockout Stage''' - ''August 4<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** Four Group Winners drawn in random order
** First drawn team picks opponents.

